  data: {
    LLM: 'In negative rounds, try to void yourself in the penalty suit early so you can discard penalty cards on tricks won by others. Save low cards for when you must win tricks.\n\nTrack which penalty cards have been played. In the King of Hearts round, if you hold the King, try to void a suit to dump it safely. Count cards to know when penalty cards might appear.\n\nIn positive rounds, coordinate with implied partners to maximize tricks. In negative rounds, force opponents to take tricks by leading suits where they have high cards. Manage your hand across all rounds, saving certain cards for specific upcoming rounds.',
    Player: 'In negative rounds, try to void yourself in the penalty suit early so you can discard penalty cards on tricks won by others. Save low cards for when you must win tricks.\n\nTrack which penalty cards have been played. In the King of Hearts round, if you hold the King, try to void a suit to dump it safely. Count cards to know when penalty cards might appear.\n\nIn positive rounds, coordinate with implied partners to maximize tricks. In negative rounds, force opponents to take tricks by leading suits where they have high cards. Manage your hand across all rounds, saving certain cards for specific upcoming rounds.',
